WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Step 6: Yield sweep and monthly payment

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:08.500
A countdown runs to the next sweep. One demo month is 5 minutes.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.657
When it hits zero, anyone can press Trigger sweep now (and earn a small tip), or the keeper does it within a minute.

4
00:00:12.657 --> 00:00:20.366
Swept: the month's yield went to the lender as extra principal, so the loan balance dropped.

5
00:00:20.366 --> 00:00:24.900
You still make the monthly installment: interest plus principal, straight to the lender.

6
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:29.900
Payment recorded. Sweeps plus payments shorten the loan. Figures are illustrative.

